# Seed template for homelab/tle-dev/misc (Vault KV v2).
#
# Copy to tle-dev-misc.env (gitignored, never committed) and fill the
# product-issued values. CSRF/token/webhook secrets are generated by
# configure-vault.sh; override here only to match existing deployments.
# Push with: ./seed-tle-dev-vault.sh
# (same literal / @file / empty rules as tle-dev-auth.env.example)
#
# --- object storage (required): MinIO console ---
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=
# --- push providers (only the ones you enable; rest stay `disabled`) ---
# Apple developer console (APNs key) / Firebase console (service-account
# JSON; paste inline or via @file, surrounding quotes are stripped).
NOTIFICATION_APNS_PRIVATE_KEY=
NOTIFICATION_FCM_CREDENTIALS_JSON=
# --- generated (override only to match an existing deployment) ---
CSRF_SECRET=
METADATA_GRPC_INTERNAL_TOKEN=
NOTIFICATION_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=
